VR-experience where you explore the refugee camp Nyarugusu in Tanzania, together with the children that live there. The experience lets you walk through the camp as if you were a refugee child, arriving at your new home in the vast refugee camp.", "short_description": "In this interactive tour of a refugee camp Plan International invites you on a journey that let's you imagine what it\u2019s like to have to flee from your home as a child, and end up in a vast refugee camp far away from home. The experience lets you walk through the camp as if you were a refugee child, arriving at your new home in the vast refugee camp."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://mynewhome.plansverige.org/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://mynewhome.plansverige.org/", "publisher_name": "Plan International Sverige", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://mynewhome.plansverige.org/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "4827770727260397"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12504788_166179640872272_3522102967765303296_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tEFb0cHj0C4Q7kNvwGu5a3I&_nc_oc=Adm1BdoR2xOJ2PNLOJUgaFfcq9AHQHhCGYVtBN-HNXAsbTWy1MF_3T6WdYI1lUYaO0s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvXZhKewrvbMRanZjo15uOZxu2RvSATxOYeD42K2ghdKA&oe=699EFDAD"}, "i